    {
      "source": "While the shared interface provides portability, each provider also offers specific features through provider-specific options classes (e.g., <code>OpenAiAudioTranscriptionOptions</code>). These classes implement the <code>AudioTranscriptionOptions</code> interface while adding provider-specific capabilities.",
      "translation": "虽然共享接口提供了可移植性，但每个提供商还通过特定于提供商的选项类（例如 <code>OpenAiAudioTranscriptionOptions</code>）提供特定的功能。这些类在实现 <code>AudioTranscriptionOptions</code> 接口的同时，增加了特定于提供商的能力。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring AI provides a unified API for Speech-to-Text transcription through the <code>TranscriptionModel</code> interface. This allows you to write portable code that works across different transcription providers.",
      "translation": "Spring AI 通过 <code style=\"color: #d63384;\">TranscriptionModel</code> 接口为语音转文本（Speech-to-Text）转录提供统一的 API。这允许您编写可在不同转录提供商之间通用的可移植代码。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"transcriptions/openai-transcriptions.html\">OpenAI’s Whisper API</a>",
      "translation": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"transcriptions/openai-transcriptions.html\">OpenAI 的 Whisper API</a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>TranscriptionModel</code> interface provides methods for converting audio to text:",
      "translation": "<code style=\"color: #d63384;\">TranscriptionModel</code> 接口提供了将音频转换为文本的方法：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>AudioTranscriptionPrompt</code> class encapsulates the input audio and options:",
      "translation": "<code style=\"color: #d73a49;\">AudioTranscriptionPrompt</code> 类封装了输入音频和选项：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>AudioTranscriptionResponse</code> class contains the transcribed text and metadata:",
      "translation": "<code style=\"color: #d73a49;\">AudioTranscriptionResponse</code> 类包含转录文本和元数据：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "All transcription providers implement the following shared interface:",
      "translation": "所有转录提供商都实现了以下共享接口：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "One of the key benefits of the shared transcription interface is the ability to write code that works with any transcription provider without modification. The actual provider (OpenAI for example) is determined by your Spring Boot configuration, allowing you to switch providers without changing application code.",
      "translation": "共享转录接口的一个核心优势是，能够编写出无需修改即可与任何转录提供商配合工作的代码。实际的提供商（例如 OpenAI）由您的 Spring Boot 配置决定，这让您可以在不更改应用程序代码的情况下切换提供商。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The shared interface allows you to write code that works with any transcription provider:",
      "translation": "共享接口允许您编写可与任何转录提供商配合工作的代码：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This service works seamlessly with OpenAI or any other transcription provider, with the actual implementation determined by your Spring Boot configuration.",
      "translation": "此服务可与 OpenAI 或任何其他转录提供商无缝配合，具体实现取决于您的 Spring Boot 配置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For detailed information about provider-specific features, see the individual provider documentation pages.",
      "translation": "有关特定提供商功能的详细信息，请参阅各提供商的独立文档页面。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
